  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "「HGUC 1/144 ジムIII」が『機動戦士ガンダム 逆襲のシャア』劇中のアクシズ落下阻止時をイメージしたカラーになって登場！",
      "en": "\"HGUC 1/144 GM III \" is now available in a color inspired by the time when Axis was stopped from falling in \" Mobile Suit Gundam: Char's Counterattack\"!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "「GUNDAM SIDE-F」で先行販売いたします。",
      "en": "Pre-sale at \"GUNDAM SIDE-F\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 劇中でのνガンダムに加勢しアクシズを押し返そうとするシーンをイメージしたメタリックな成形色で立体化、ポリキャップも新規成形色で表現。",
      "en": "• Three-dimensional with metallic molding color inspired by the scene in the movie where νGundam joins forces with Axis to push back, and the polycap is also expressed in a new molding color."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• バイザー部分はクリアパーツで表現。また、多彩な手首パーツが付属。",
      "en": "• The visor part is expressed with clear parts. In addition, various wrist parts are included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• プラモデルオリジナルのマーキングシールが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with the plastic model's original MarkingSeal."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 各部関節が可動し、様々なポージングが可能。",
      "en": "• Each joint is movable, allowing various poses."
    }
  ],
